WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.894 --> 00:00:02.479
He is a professor,

00:00:02.675 --> 00:00:03.635
researcher,

00:00:04.063 --> 00:00:05.565
and thoracic surgeon,

00:00:05.865 --> 00:00:07.449
Doctor Paolo Macchiarini.

00:00:10.293 --> 00:00:12.045
The work I do could change the world.

00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:15.374
It’s all smoke and mirrors.

00:00:16.424 --> 00:00:17.592
I need to know the truth.

00:00:19.412 --> 00:00:20.580
What did you do, Paolo?

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.064
What did you do to them?

